OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FPassengers at Gatwick airport have no
OL,7,Faccess to working toilets or bars and
OL,8,Frestaurants because of a water supply
OL,9,Ffailure.
OL,11,FAlthough flights are unaffected,
OL,12,Fseveral services have been compromised
OL,13,Fat both of the Sussex airport's
OL,14,Fterminals, with passengers posting
OL,15,Fonline that they are unable to get hot
OL,16,Fdrinks, wash their hands or fill up
OL,17,Fwater bottles.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
