PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FBottled water is being given to
OL,7,Ftravellers at the airport because of
OL,8,Fthe problem that is also affecting
OL,9,Fpeople living in Kent and Sussex.
OL,11,FWater firm SES Water said: "We are
OL,12,Fcurrently experiencing interruptions
OL,13,Fto water supplies in parts of the TN
OL,14,F11, RH1, RH6, and RH10 postcode areas.
OL,16,F"Our teams are on site and working to
OL,17,Frestore supplies as quickly and safely
OL,18,Fas possible. Customers in some areas
OL,19,Fmay experience low pressure or no
OL,20,Fwater while recovery work is completed.
OL,26,@sD@\OUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
