CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FGatwick Airport said: "A water issue
OL,7,Fin the Horley area is causing
OL,8,Fdisruption at the airport this
OL,9,Fmorning. The problem is affecting
OL,10,Fwater supply in both terminals and is
OL,11,Fcurrently under investigation.
OL,13,F"Bottled water is being made available
OL,14,Fto passengers and staff across the
OL,15,Fairport and other contingency measures
OL,16,Fare being put in place to ensure the
OL,17,Fwelfare of our passengers.
OL,19,F"We will provide further updates and
OL,20,Fapologise for any inconvenience to
OL,21,Fpassengers."
OL,26,@nD@WOUuD@AOU{D@AOU}D@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
