OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FTalkTV presenter Julia Hartley-Brewer
OL,7,Fposted on X: "If you're on your way to
OL,8,FGatwick Airport, it might be helpful
OL,9,Fto know that there is no running water
OL,10,Facross the entire airport.
OL,12,F"That means no coffees, no water
OL,13,Ffountains, no flushing toilets and no
OL,14,Fhand washing.
OL,16,F"Gatwick hasn't bothered to make a
OL,17,Fpublic announcement about this to
OL,18,Fpassengers. How helpful..."
OL,26,@oD@NOUtD@AOUxD@AOUzD@[O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
