OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FOn Facebook, one user posted: "Gasping
OL,7,Ffor a drink & crossing my legs right
OL,8,Fnow. This is ridiculous! Gatwick
OL,9,Fairport has shut all restaurants and
OL,10,Fmost toilets due to a water outage.
OL,12,F"Not a great start to the holiday."
OL,14,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
