OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FFormer MP and recently appointed
OL,7,FGovernment "music champion" Michael
OL,8,FDugher wrote on social media: "At
OL,9,Fleast allow people to use the chairs
OL,10,Fin all the closed restaurants and
OL,11,Fbars. No water is one thing, but
OL,12,Fdepriving people of somewhere to sit
OL,13,Fis another... families are having to
OL,14,Fsit on the floor..."
OL,16,FRoger Wood, from Tunbridge Wells,
OL,17,FKent, arrived at Gatwick South
OL,18,FTerminal at around 11am on Sunday to
OL,19,Ffly to New York.
OL,26,@oD@LOUoD@[O]pD@_OUvD@TO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
