CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FHe told the Press Association: "There
OL,7,Fwas no communication. We arrived at
OL,8,F11ish and it had only started recently.
OL,10,F"We met friends at the bar but they
OL,11,Fcouldn't serve us as they were unable
OL,12,Fto wash their hands.
OL,14,F"I've never seen Wetherspoons empty.
OL,15,FNo idea when it'll be resolved, the
OL,16,Ftoilets also lacked water to wash
OL,17,Fhands."
OL,19,FIn a statement at 2pm, SES said:
OL,26,@nD@`OUrD@AOUvD@AOUyD@GO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
