OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785152167
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,F"We are pleased to provide an update
OL,7,Fthat our Bough Beech water treatment
OL,8,Fworks are back up and running, we now
OL,9,Fneed to treat the water before
OL,10,Freturning services to normal as
OL,11,Fquickly as we possibly can.
OL,13,F"We would like to thank customers and
OL,14,Four partners at Gatwick Airport for
OL,15,Ftheir continued patience, and we are
OL,16,Fsorry for the inconvenience this is
OL,17,Fcausing.
OL,19,F"We will update you on the progress of
OL,20,Fthe work as soon as we can."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
